Bundle-Name: Eclipse Fennec Stream Mapping Model
Bundle-Description: Streaming policies on top of the generic Fennec mapping: StreamMapping and \
	StreamSlot (change rules, projection and recording mode, lateness, batching, execution group, \
	retention), with their defaults on the mapping.

src=${^src},src-gen

-workingset: streaming

-library: enableEMF

-generate:\
	model/streammapping.genmodel;\
		generate=fennecEMF;\
		lineEndings=lf;\
		genmodel=model/streammapping.genmodel;\
		output=src-gen

-includeresource.model: model=model

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.service.condition;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.atlas.configuration.model;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.mapping.model;version=snapshot

-testpath: \
	assertj-core
